#: docs/installation.rst:2
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: docs/installation.rst:5
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "环境要求"

#: docs/installation.rst:7
msgid "Linux or Windows on x86_64."
msgstr "x86_64 架构的 Linux 或 Windows。"

#: docs/installation.rst:8
msgid "CPython 3.10 or newer; free-threaded CPython 3.13 or newer is supported."
msgstr "CPython 3.10 或更新版本；支持 free-threaded CPython 3.13 或更新版本。"

#: docs/installation.rst:9
msgid "The separately installed Mech-Eye C++ SDK 2.6.0."
msgstr "单独安装的 Mech-Eye C++ SDK 2.6.0。"

#: docs/installation.rst:10
msgid "A C++17 toolchain: GCC/Clang on Linux, or MSVC x64 on Windows."
msgstr "C++17 工具链：Linux 使用 GCC/Clang，Windows 使用 MSVC x64。"

#: docs/installation.rst:12
msgid ""
"The SDK is available from the `Mech-Mind download center <https://downloads.mech-"
"mind.com/?tab=tab-sdk>`_. SDK files are not included in the Python distribution. The "
"Python extension uses the regular CPython ABI, so it is rebuilt for each Python minor"
" version and threading ABI."
msgstr ""
"SDK 可从 `Mech-Mind download center <https://downloads.mech-mind.com/?tab=tab-sdk>`_ "
"获取。Python 分发包不包含 SDK 文件。扩展使用普通 CPython ABI，因此每个 Python 次版本和线程 ABI 都需要重新编译。"

#: docs/installation.rst:18
msgid "Select the SDK"
msgstr "选择 SDK"

#: docs/installation.rst:20
msgid ""
"``MECHEYE_SDK_ROOT`` overrides the platform default. It must be an absolute directory"
" containing ``include`` and the runtime/import library directories."
msgstr "``MECHEYE_SDK_ROOT`` 覆盖平台默认路径。它必须是包含 ``include`` 及运行库／导入库目录的绝对目录路径。"

