#: docs/installation.rst:65
msgid ""
"Importing the package checks the platform, Python ABI, and exact SDK runtime SHA-256 "
"recorded at compilation. A different runtime is rejected with ``ImportError``. After "
"changing the SDK, rebuild and restart the interpreter:"
msgstr ""
"导入时会检查平台、Python ABI 和编译时记录的 SDK 运行库 SHA-256。运行库不匹配时抛出 ``ImportError``。更换 SDK "
"后，请重新编译并重启解释器："

